<title>USA: Davel says to buy Blair Telephone assets.</title>
<headline>Davel says to buy Blair Telephone assets.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Davel Communications Group Inc said Thursday it intends to acquire the assets of Blair Telephone Co for about $3.8 million in cash.</p>
<p>The purchase is subject to the execution of a definitive receipt of required regulatory approvals and the satisfactory completion of due diligence review.</p>
<p>The company expects the acquisition to close by the end of the month.</p>
</text>
